On Apr 10, 4:56 am, "fixitgirl" <gir...@gmail.com> wrote:
> > > I've just started playing nethack recently, and was wondering how I
> > > could tame more pets, and how to polymorph into different things.

Welcome to Nethack.  Pets can be a fun component of the game and can
do a lot towards helping you move towards ascension.  I have a lot of
fun with my Nethack pets so I'll see if I can give you some advice.
Another good source is the Pacifist spoiler at
http://home.nycap.rr.com/rduhan/steves/pacfaq02.html .  It's some good
reading.

Another method of acquiring pets that has not already been mentioned
is by turning into a lycanthrope (were-jackal/rat/wolf) and using
#monster to summon help.

The most effective method I've used for polymorphing pets is to find a
magic whistle, a polytrap and a bunch of pets and blow on my magic
whistle until I get a good pet.  In the early game I'll use a wand if
I think that it will increase my survival chances.  Just for your
convenience, once you get a pet turned into a Demi/Arch-lich or Gray
Dragon don't expect it to change anymore.  The trick is finding the
polytrap before it finds you.  Having intrinsic searching helps as
does the knowledge that polytraps don't appear until Level 8.


