>
> And on a side note:  how do you "unstack" items?  I really didn't want
> to drop all 12 tripe rations at once.

others have already told how to drop a single item.  To "unstack" same
items with same disclosure levels you'll need to use the #name
command.
1) #name the stack's inventory letter "foo-1"
2) (d)rop 1 item of the stack
3) #name the stack's inventory letter "foo-2"
repeat as desired.

This is useful when you want to wield something stackable and fragile
(e.g. eggs, potions, etc.)

